{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434820/extras/38222b1b2a7ab863b1ea560d5512f02f.avif?t=1757015028\" width=600 height=160 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >King Aldric's Paladin Guard</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434820/extras/4e9d6a79d4c3f54702debd78ef60cc80.avif?t=1757015028\" width=630 height=240 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the king's new tactician. Organize and deploy the paladin guard to protect important shipments headed north through a dangerous new landscape. Take control of Roland and his squire Oliver in combat. Equip them and power them up to meet the challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Protect Your Convoy on the Perilous Journey North</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434820/extras/c232765e7904f3851057ff5189b97405.avif?t=1757015028\" width=630 height=170 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple convoy assignments to choose from, each with their own abilities, advantages, and disadvantages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choose Your Route</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434820/extras/3a1244c98f55613ecceb9fc50d017190.poster.avif?t=1757015028\" width=520 height=608 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434820/extras/3a1244c98f55613ecceb9fc50d017190.webm?t=1757015028\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434820/extras/3a1244c98f55613ecceb9fc50d017190.mp4?t=1757015028\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate the world map and decide which branching paths to take. Some may be more challenging and rewarding than others. Some may lead you to new surprises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Find Treasure and Merchants Along the Way</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434820/extras/b3fc7513f50eff762a6d50ee80ceca40.poster.avif?t=1757015028\" width=630 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434820/extras/b3fc7513f50eff762a6d50ee80ceca40.webm?t=1757015028\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434820/extras/b3fc7513f50eff762a6d50ee80ceca40.mp4?t=1757015028\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect gold and other loot on your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434820/extras/f28116f6f65b542c7b41d89657d8f212.poster.avif?t=1757015028\" width=630 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434820/extras/f28116f6f65b542c7b41d89657d8f212.webm?t=1757015028\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434820/extras/f28116f6f65b542c7b41d89657d8f212.mp4?t=1757015028\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stop by merchants on your way and buy useful items. There are dozens of unique items to discover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Recruit Blades for Hire</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434820/extras/35ec584bf038127fb61f933b2c4375f2.avif?t=1757015028\" width=630 height=260 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434820/extras/f8ba8d89baa802652771369f01d44548.avif?t=1757015028\" width=630 height=168 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some areas may have mercenaries for hire. If you have the gold you can add them to your team to increase your odds, and each having their own unique support abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Retro Pixel Graphics and Modern Pinball Physics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pinball Paladins brings responsive controls and interactive environments to a classic 16-bit atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434820/extras/b4f0640fa61257160b96e86d1692bc17.poster.avif?t=1757015028\" width=512 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434820/extras/b4f0640fa61257160b96e86d1692bc17.webm?t=1757015028\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434820/extras/b4f0640fa61257160b96e86d1692bc17.mp4?t=1757015028\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pinball Paladins keeps the retro look with vector physics on the back end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Design is Very Human</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With an excellent chiptune soundtrack and handmade pixel art, no Gen AI was used to create assets for this game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434820/extras/3bb32d72256a1beda2e8ac3f30d88cc9.avif?t=1757015028\" width=240 height=240 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3434820?t=1757015028","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434820/9e6eb5dfa6b4013577c3de2e82b1e83d18380441/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757015028","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434820/a414aa7f7709c6905642bb91fb5c00d03258b1d1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757015028","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434820/a414aa7f7709c6905642bb91fb5c00d03258b1d1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757015028","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3960690,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434820/extras/38222b1b2a7ab863b1ea560d5512f02f.avif?t=1757015028\" width=600 height=160 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >King Aldric's Paladin Guard</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434820/extras/4e9d6a79d4c3f54702debd78ef60cc80.avif?t=1757015028\" width=630 height=240 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the king's new tactician. Organize and deploy the paladin guard to protect important shipments headed north through a dangerous new landscape. Take control of Roland and his squire Oliver in combat. Equip them and power them up to meet the challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Protect Your Convoy on the Perilous Journey North</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434820/extras/c232765e7904f3851057ff5189b97405.avif?t=1757015028\" width=630 height=170 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple convoy assignments to choose from, each with their own abilities, advantages, and disadvantages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choose Your Route</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434820/extras/3a1244c98f55613ecceb9fc50d017190.poster.avif?t=1757015028\" width=520 height=608 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434820/extras/3a1244c98f55613ecceb9fc50d017190.webm?t=1757015028\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434820/extras/3a1244c98f55613ecceb9fc50d017190.mp4?t=1757015028\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate the world map and decide which branching paths to take. Some may be more challenging and rewarding than others. Some may lead you to new surprises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Find Treasure and Merchants Along the Way</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434820/extras/b3fc7513f50eff762a6d50ee80ceca40.poster.avif?t=1757015028\" width=630 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434820/extras/b3fc7513f