 and Modern Pinball Physics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pinball Paladins brings responsive controls and interactive environments to a classic 16-bit atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434820/extras/b4f0640fa61257160b96e86d1692bc17.poster.avif?t=1757015028\" width=512 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434820/extras/b4f0640fa61257160b96e86d1692bc17.webm?t=1757015028\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434820/extras/b4f0640fa61257160b96e86d1692bc17.mp4?t=1757015028\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pinball Paladins keeps the retro look with vector physics on the back end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Design is Very Human</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With an excellent chiptune soundtrack and handmade pixel art, no Gen AI was used to create assets for this game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434820/extras/3bb32d72256a1beda2e8ac3f30d88cc9.avif?t=1757015028\" width=240 height=240 /></span></p>","developers":["Offhand Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434820/80413b634e7d791147d920bf7c9ab79197c45da8/header.jpg?t=1757015028","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Copyright Offhand Games 2025 \u00a9","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3434820/377041067/76febc99ebdd222f38ead3